# 301 Permanent Redirects for Legacy URLs & Tag Variants

# ── Blogger ?m=1 mobile query param strip ────────────────────────────────────
# GSC group-1 errors: Google found these Blogger mobile URLs on the Astro site.
# Netlify supports query-string matching with the ?param=value syntax.
/?m=1  /  301!
/contact?m=1  /contact  301!
/p/contact-us?m=1  /contact  301!
/blog/*?m=1  /blog/:splat  301!

# ── Old Blogger year-based post URLs → /blog ─────────────────────────────────
# Catches /2026/01/..., /2026/02/..., /2025/..., etc.
# GSC group-2 errors: these old Blogger posts 404 on the Astro site.
/2026/*  /blog  301!
/2025/*  /blog  301!
/2024/*  /blog  301!

